  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Pressed Powder Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Radiant Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>An innovative, clean highlighting powder that melts onto skin imparting a pure, radiant glow that optically smooths and illuminates.</p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: </strong></p><p>- Fermented Arnica Oil: Rich in potent antioxidant and <span style=\" color: var(--attrpanel-color-text, #1a2028); font-size: var(--font-size-sm, 12px) ; background-color: var(--palette-white, #ffffff);\">and anti-inflammatory properties.</span></p><p>- Silver Vine Extract: Brightens skin to promote a smooth complexion.</p><p>- Talc-Free</p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Sweep across the face and body as desired.<br>-Build and blend to intensify the glow.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Fermented Arnica Oil: Rich in potent antioxidant and soothing properties.<br>-Silver Vine Extract: Brightens skin to promote a smooth complexion.<br>-Talc-Free<br><br>Mica, Cetearyl Ethylhexanoate, Hdi/Trimethylol Hexyllactone Crosspolymer,  Glycerin, Pseudozyma Epicola/Sunflower Seed Oil Ferment Extract Filtrate, Arnica  Montana Flower Extract**, Squalane, Actinidia Polygama Fruit Extract, Tocopherol,  Ethylhexylglycerin, Gellen Gum, Caprylyl Glycol, Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Calcium  Chloride, Butylene Glycol, Silica, Dicalcium Phosphate, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-Di-T-Butyl  Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, 1,2-Hexanediol, Polysorbate 20, Aqua (Water, Eau), Ci 77491 (Iron  Oxides), Ci 77891 (Titanium Dioxide). **Fermented <br><br><br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
